      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "N—short beat—Nuthatch. A nuthatch is a small bird that often climbs along tree trunks and branches while searching bark for food.",
